<h1>each</h1>

<h2>Over an array (with @data variables)</h2>
<ol>
{{#each people}}
  <li>{{@index}}: {{this}}{{#if @first}} — first{{/if}}{{#if @last}} — last{{/if}}</li>
{{/each}}
</ol>

<h2>Over an object (@key is the property name)</h2>
<dl>
{{#each profile}}
  <dt>{{@key}}</dt><dd>{{this}}</dd>
{{/each}}
</dl>

<h2>Empty collections render the inverse (else) block</h2>
<ul>
{{#each archived}}
  <li>{{title}}</li>
{{else}}
  <li><em>Nothing archived.</em></li>
{{/each}}
</ul>

<h2>Nested each — ../ reaches the outer item</h2>
<ul>
{{#each teams}}
  <li>{{name}}:
    {{#each members}}<span>{{this}} ({{../name}})</span> {{/each}}
  </li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
